# Navbar

Three layouts. Switch between desktop, mobile, and code in each preview.

## Developer portal

Three links, search, merge requests, and account menu. Account actions are demo-only.

<Sandbox variant="developer" title="Developer portal" />

## Mega menu · two rows

Full-width panels, featured content, and secondary navigation.

<Sandbox variant="marketing" title="Mega menu / two rows" />

## Floating · compact

Inset navbar with compact dropdowns.

<Sandbox variant="floating" title="Floating / compact" />

## Usage

Set `menu: 'mega'` for a stable full-width panel and `menuTrigger="hover"` for hover activation. Use `menuOpenDelay` and `menuCloseDelay` to tune hover intent. On desktop, Left and Right move between navigation entries, Home and End jump to the edges, and Down opens a focused menu. Use `onsearch`, `avatar.items`, `utilities`, and `secondary` for search, account menus, icon buttons, and a second row.
